# .claude-policy - place this file in the ROOT of a file share (e.g. \\fs01\projects\.claude-policy).
# Every PC running the windows-server-search Claude plugin picks it up automatically (re-read every 5 minutes).
# Claude can neither find (search), list, read nor copy matching files and folders.
#
# Syntax (like .gitignore, case-insensitive, / and \ both work):
#   name          matches a file or folder with that name at any depth in this share
#   /name         only directly in the share root
#   a/b           a path relative to the share root (anchored because it contains a slash)
#   *             any characters within one name     ?   one character
#   **            any number of folders
# A matching folder blocks everything below it. Lines starting with # are comments.
# "!" negations are not supported (rules can only block, never re-allow).
# Protect this file with NTFS permissions so that only administrators can change it.

# Personal folders anywhere in the share
Personal/

# HR and payroll data in the share root
/HR
/Payroll*

# Contracts folders one level below any project
*/Contracts/

# Sensitive file types
*.kdbx
*.pfx
